{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mourningwood Lodge2:Hidden Voice&quot; is a full-motion video (FMV) live-action horror mystery game. As the second installment in the &quot;Mourningwood\u00a0Lodge&quot; series and a prequel to the original title, it introduces an entirely new storyline where players assume the role of a fresh character embarking on an intensely terrifying journey. In the game, players step into the shoes of Qin Zhaodi, a rookie police officer who becomes entangled in a series of eerie and horrifying incidents while investigating a string of serial killings. Throughout the experience, players must search for clues and piece together evidence to uncover the truth behind the case and reveal hidden secrets\u2014all while determining the ultimate fate of every character involved. The lives of all hang in the balance, and every decision must be made with utmost caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will assume the role of Qin Zhaodi, a rookie police officer who, after serving for some time, finally gets her first field assignment: investigating a string of serial killings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/106f62c2a803b222bf31aa1e380829d0.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bEvidence Collection\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can search individuals involved in the events to gather clues, and based on these clues, unlock corresponding testimony flashbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/3067dcc0a5b813fbbacac3f8cc07511b.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bJudgment\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At critical junctures in the game, players must make their own decisions. Each choice will influence how the truth of the story is uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/e6b9a0eb88ac51fe6165e98e4e9dd7e6.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bChoices\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During life-or-death decision points, players must use clues to make the correct choices. Failure to do so may lead to catastrophic outcomes, including the potential for a total party wipe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/03ad73e9e6c336a27ff50194c72e6bed.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bInvestigation\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the process, players must conduct inquiries into various events to uncover more details about the case and ultimately reveal the truth behind the incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/4e025506a52d7df1b644d8e894eda0bd.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural </strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter numerous eerie incidents throughout the game, and their choices during these events will determine the ultimate outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/30369c247a3955315a4be91bdae12f36.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bizarre Homicide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/6c58b838bc736aeb96bd1ac2906caed541ce7cf4.jpg"},{"name":"Eerie Nursery Rhyme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/89850d8559c87a2b1c2f8272957b5122ab79ffb1.jpg"},{"name":"Trapped Like a Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/897f6850c9717539c46adcf7135cf630f76566a6.jpg"},{"name":"Zhuangzi\u2019s Butterfly Dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/a3b128e6413df3e3829fd522a4fca44a1ec7134c.jpg"},{"name":"Sudden Turn of Events","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/b7ef7b40d0c8d2cfdef6831365ecc761dda76cd5.jpg"},{"name":"A Glimmer of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/10010ef0dafa9688b9a60985ef074dbf99a8cd22.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn After the Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/59b76a3b6a88d1df37fcf22e38b12c742982b51d.jpg"},{"name":"Faint Whispers in the Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/2e40d352349be00b92c7391c9acab2bd6a96514e.jpg"},{"name":"A Needle in Mianmian\u2019s Smile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025330/1f33b79acbbc67f928accb2fb80391b169f0b303.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025330?t=1761613337","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/14d663da28632bc2ff6ce26346fd97f1db05daeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761613337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/cd01cdc43b346e348ebc121009946f3f4a74fa6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761613337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/cd01cdc43b346e348ebc121009946f3f4a74fa6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761613337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game includes  frequent scenes disturbing and horrific scenes of implied violence, gore and mutilation of human bodies. It may have a realistic triggering impact on players with potential sensitivities. Player discretion is advised.\r\nMay not be suitable for all age groups."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mourningwood Lodge2:Hidden Voice&quot; is a full-motion video (FMV) live-action horror mystery game. As the second installment in the &quot;Mourningwood\u00a0Lodge&quot; series and a prequel to the original title, it introduces an entirely new storyline where players assume the role of a fresh character embarking on an intensely terrifying journey. In the game, players step into the shoes of Qin Zhaodi, a rookie police officer who becomes entangled in a series of eerie and horrifying incidents while investigating a string of serial killings. Throughout the experience, players must search for clues and piece together evidence to uncover the truth behind the case and reveal hidden secrets\u2014all while determining the ultimate fate of every character involved. The lives of all hang in the balance, and every decision must be made with utmost caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p clas