/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/03ad73e9e6c336a27ff50194c72e6bed.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bInvestigation\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the process, players must conduct inquiries into various events to uncover more details about the case and ultimately reveal the truth behind the incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/4e025506a52d7df1b644d8e894eda0bd.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural </strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter numerous eerie incidents throughout the game, and their choices during these events will determine the ultimate outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/30369c247a3955315a4be91bdae12f36.avif?t=1761613337\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["MYSTERY CROWN","\u706b\u8725\u8734\u6587\u5316"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/dbf8d16acc37b5fd17ddc775bdf792b0d4e2fe23/header.jpg?t=1761613337","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS High Sierra 10.13<br></li><li><stron